+HARDENING / PRODUCTION OPERATIONS
+
+This patch adds scaffolding for:
+- Sandbox hardening: RuntimeClass (kata), seccomp, AppArmor, NetworkPolicy and an image-signature admission webhook (cosign).
+- Verifier calibration: tools and CI workflow to compute calibrated thresholds from labeled corpora.
+- Retriever & Milvus ops: production helm values, backup cronjob and backup helper container.
+- PREEMPT_RT / HIL: scripts and CI job templates for validating real-time nodes via cyclictest.
+- Authn/Authz & mTLS: JWKS JWT verification helper and scripts to generate mTLS certs and rotate webhook CA.
+- Admission resilience: webhook CA rotation helper, webhook deployment + ValidatingWebhookConfiguration placeholder.
+- Compliance automation: redaction checker and sanitization pipeline with cronjob.
+
+Next steps (operator)
+1. Install kata runtime and configure node image + kubelet to enable RuntimeClass 'kata' on sandbox node pool.
+2. Provision cosign public key (cosign-key secret) and create TLS secret for webhook; patch image-webhook-config caBundle.
+3. Deploy Milvus with production values, provision S3 bucket for backups and test restore.
